gbHL(){return'\u2022 An order comes as an offer \u2014 "Accept" or "Skip".\n\u2022 The navigator guides you with a blue line, the minimap is on the right. The passenger gets in when the car stands nearby for a moment.\n\u2022 "In a hurry" pays more but you must make it in time. "Comfort" gives generous tips but cannot stand bumps. "Group" accelerates slower.\n\u2022 Hitting a building or a car angers the passenger and dents the car: at zero durability the shift ends and the car needs repairs.\n\u2022 Five stars in a row is a streak, with a bonus of up to +30%. A high rating means more "Comfort" orders. A pricier car means a higher rate.\n\u2022 Fuel comes out of your earnings. Game time runs as usual; up to 8 hours at the wheel per day.'},
