aVJ(a,b){return"10 lines, wins are based on the bet per line (bet \xf7 10). \ud83d\udc02 is WILD: it replaces any symbol, three bulls pay the most. Sometimes \u201cBull Rage\u201d kicks in: one symbol and bulls stay on the reels, and it respins until a win lands (at least \xd7"+a+" of your bet). A full screen with no empty cells pays \xd7"+b+"."},
aVH(a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h){return"20 lines left to right, wins are based on the bet per line (bet \xf7 20). Cascades: winning symbols pop and new ones drop in from above \u2014 until there are no more wins. \ud83c\udccf WILD replaces any symbol except \ud83c\udf81. \ud83c\udf81 on screen after cascades: 3 \u2014 \xd7"+a+" of your bet and "+b+" free spins, 4 \u2014 \xd7"+c+" and "+d+", 5 \u2014 \xd7"+e+" and "+f+". In free spins everything is \xd7"+g+", three \ud83c\udf81 give +"+h+" more."},
aVI(a,b,c){return"10 lines left to right, wins are based on the bet per line (bet \xf7 10). Coins on lines don't pay, but "+a+" or more on screen open the safe: coins stay in place and the other cells respin. You get "+b+" tries, a new coin resets them. At the end all coins pay out (\xd70.5 \u2026 \xd725 of your bet), and all 15 cells filled with coins give a GRAND \xd7"+c+" on top."},
aVK(a,b,c,d,e){return"20 lines left to right, wins are based on the bet per line (bet \xf7 20). \u2b50 Sheriff is WILD. Above the reels there is a multiplier strip: every spin lands \xd71\u2026\xd715 and your whole line win is multiplied by it. \ud83d\udcdc anywhere: 3 \u2014 \xd7"+a+" of your bet and "+b+" free spins, 4 \u2014 "+c+", 5 \u2014 "+d+". In free spins the multiplier is at least \xd72, three \ud83d\udcdc give +"+e+" more."},
aVF(a,b){return"10 lines left to right, wins are based on the bet per line (bet \xf7 10). \ud83d\udcd6 Book is WILD and a bonus at once. 3 books anywhere \u2014 \xd7"+a+" of your bet and "+b+" free spins, and a special symbol is picked before them. In free spins it expands across the whole reel and pays on all lines, even if the reels are not consecutive (\ud83e\udd85 \ud83d\udc51 \ud83d\udc3a \u2014 from two reels, the rest \u2014 from three). Three books give +"+b+" more. \ud83e\udddf Walking Mummy: sometimes covers a whole reel as WILD and gives free respins, stepping one reel left each time until she leaves the grid."},
aVG(a,b,c,d,e){return"20 lines left to right, wins are based on the bet per line (bet \xf7 20). \ud83d\udc3c Panda is WILD. \ud83c\udf8d Secret bamboo: all its cells turn into the same symbol \u2014 it can be a panda too. \ud83c\udf8b anywhere: 3 \u2014 \xd7"+a+" of your bet and "+b+" free spins, 4 \u2014 "+c+", 5 \u2014 "+d+". In free spins there is twice as much bamboo, it expands into high symbols, and every expansion adds +1 to the multiplier until the end of the bonus. Three \ud83c\udf8b give +"+e+" more."},
